{
  "id": "confirm",
  "title_cn": "确认框",
  "owner": "M5",
  "note": "通用确认框（原版 ot/sys 的 if_* 族）。原版 if_ok/if_ok2/if_yes/if_no/if_cancl 五件为 168–228×25 的**按钮日文图**（はい／いいえ／キャンセル），不可复用；边框改用九宫格件 panel_frame.png（中心透明，填充另加 rect），按钮文字由引擎绘制。提示文本用通用 UI 词，不涉剧情。",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "confirm.backdrop",
      "kind": "rect",
      "z": 0,
      "visible_default": true,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 1920,
      "h": 1080,
      "color": "@palette.backdrop",
      "opacity": "@palette.backdrop_opa",
      "note": "全屏压暗遮罩（确认框为模态覆盖层）"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm.panel_fill",
      "kind": "rect",
      "z": 10,
      "visible_default": true,
      "x": 630,
      "y": 405,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 270,
      "color": "@palette.panel_fill",
      "opacity": "@palette.panel_fill_opa",
      "note": "确认框面板填充（九宫格边框的中心透明区由此补齐）"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm.panel_frame",
      "kind": "image",
      "z": 11,
      "visible_default": true,
      "asset": "ui/panel_frame.png",
      "x": 630,
      "y": 405,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 270,
      "nine": {
        "l": 20,
        "t": 8,
        "r": 20,
        "b": 8
      },
      "opacity": 240,
      "source": "UI 组自制：九宫格边框件 ui/panel_frame.png（由 if_lt/rt/lb/rb + if_tbar/bbar + if_lbar/rbar 拼合）",
      "note": "确认框九宫格边框（可拉伸至任意尺寸；原版整页确认图 sl_data/ex_* 属 R1 类不可用）"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm.text",
      "kind": "text",
      "z": 20,
      "visible_default": true,
      "x": 666,
      "y": 444,
      "w": 588,
      "h": 90,
      "font": {
        "size": 33,
        "bold": false,
        "color": "@palette.text_primary",
        "shadow": true,
        "shadow_color": "@palette.shadow",
        "shadow_ofs": 3
      },
      "align": "center",
      "valign": "middle",
      "wrap": true,
      "max_lines": 2,
      "line_spacing": 1.4,
      "sample": "要返回标题画面吗？\n未保存的进度将丢失。",
      "note": "提示文本（中文，引擎绘制；内容为通用 UI 词，由调用方按场合替换，非剧情文本）"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm.btn_yes_fill",
      "kind": "rect",
      "z": 30,
      "visible_default": true,
      "x": 750,
      "y": 570,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 66,
      "color": "@palette.panel_fill",
      "opacity": "@palette.panel_fill_opa",
      "note": "「是」按钮底"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm.btn_yes_frame",
      "kind": "image",
      "z": 31,
      "visible_default": true,
      "asset": "ui/panel_frame.png",
      "x": 750,
      "y": 570,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 66,
      "nine": {
        "l": 20,
        "t": 8,
        "r": 20,
        "b": 8
      },
      "opacity": 235,
      "source": "UI 组自制：九宫格边框件 ui/panel_frame.png",
      "note": "「是」按钮边框"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm.btn_yes",
      "kind": "hit",
      "z": 32,
      "visible_default": true,
      "x": 750,
      "y": 570,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 66,
      "action": "close",
      "label": "是",
      "font": {
        "size": 33,
        "bold": false,
        "color": "@palette.text_menu_sel",
        "shadow": true,
        "shadow_color": "@palette.shadow",
        "shadow_ofs": 2
      },
      "align": "center",
      "note": "确认（肯定）按钮。原版 if_yes「はい」含日文烘焙不可用，改引擎绘字；action 动作表暂无 confirm_yes，暂用 close 占位（返回值由编程组按 confirm_result 处理）——见 M5 报告「需裁决点」"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm.btn_no_fill",
      "kind": "rect",
      "z": 30,
      "visible_default": true,
      "x": 990,
      "y": 570,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 66,
      "color": "@palette.panel_fill",
      "opacity": "@palette.panel_fill_opa",
      "note": "「否」按钮底"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm.btn_no_frame",
      "kind": "image",
      "z": 31,
      "visible_default": true,
      "asset": "ui/panel_frame.png",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 570,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 66,
      "nine": {
        "l": 20,
        "t": 8,
        "r": 20,
        "b": 8
      },
      "opacity": 235,
      "source": "UI 组自制：九宫格边框件 ui/panel_frame.png",
      "note": "「否」按钮边框"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm.btn_no",
      "kind": "hit",
      "z": 32,
      "visible_default": true,
      "x": 990,
      "y": 570,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 66,
      "action": "close",
      "label": "否",
      "font": {
        "size": 33,
        "bold": false,
        "color": "@palette.text_menu",
        "shadow": true,
        "shadow_color": "@palette.shadow",
        "shadow_ofs": 2
      },
      "align": "center",
      "note": "取消（否定）按钮。原版 if_no「いいえ」含日文烘焙不可用，改引擎绘字；action 同 confirm.btn_yes 的占位说明"
    }
  ]
}
